--- !u!114 &517905822
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 517905818}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 14ce5c596a29e284c91b0e2209200b81, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  encounterID: 
  active: 1
  blockInteraction: 0
  failBranch: 
  dialog:
  - text: Hey... Have you seen a kid by the name of Spartan Jack?
    name: Storm
    character: {fileID: 0}
    pose: HandsOnHips
    cameraAngle: 0
    face: Confused
  - text: 'Oh, the new kid?

      Yeah, seen him. A lot actually.

      The ninja
      council got me stalkin ''em'
    name: Ninja
    character: {fileID: 517905819}
    pose: SittingDown
    cameraAngle: 2
    face: Confused
  - text: But he hasn't been 'round here. Last I saw, he was on his way to the You
      Jitsu school - I tell 'ya, they're up to something funny in there
    name: Ninja
    character: {fileID: 517905819}
    pose: SittingDown
    cameraAngle: 0
    face: Confused
  - text: ...Then what happened?
    name: Storm
    character: {fileID: 0}
    pose: HandsOnHips
    cameraAngle: 0
    face: Confused
  - text: 'Can''t tell ''ya, I clocked out.

      Now I''m here, and I put some
      fat stacks on the King. Sure bet.'
    name: Ninja
    character: {fileID: 517905819}
    pose: SittingDown
    cameraAngle: 0
    face: Confused
  - text: (Well, that rules out the fight club - but dang, if even the ninja council
      can't find him?? He's either a prodigy, or something fishy IS going on)
    name: 
    character: {fileID: 0}
    pose: HandsOnHips
    cameraAngle: 2
    face: Confused
  - text: (I could look elsewhere... Or I could go down there, prepare my battle
      deck and fight for that fat bounty)
    name: 
    character: {fileID: 0}
    pose: HandsOnHips
    cameraAngle: 2
    face: Confused
  turnToFace: 0
  snapPlayerPosition: 0
